# параметр|значение|подпись
VirtualMode|Ext_Phy_Host|
VirtualMode|Ext_Phy_Device|
VirtualMode|Int_Phy_Host|
VirtualMode|Int_Phy_Device|
phy_itface|USB_OTG_ULPI_PHY|External Phy
phy_itface|USB_OTG_HS_EMBEDDED_PHY|Internal Phy
phy_itface|USB_OTG_EMBEDDED_PHY|Internal Phy
speed|USB_OTG_SPEED_HIGH|High Speed 480MBit/s
speed|USB_OTG_SPEED_HIGH_IN_FULL|Host Full Speed 12MBit/s
speed|USB_OTG_SPEED_LOW|Low Speed 1.5MBit/s
speed|USB_OTG_SPEED_FULL|Low Speed 1.5MBit/s
ep0_mps|DEP0CTL_MPS_64|64 Bytes
ep0_mps|DEP0CTL_MPS_32|32 Bytes
ep0_mps|DEP0CTL_MPS_16|16 Bytes
ep0_mps|DEP0CTL_MPS_8|8 Bytes
